description: Merchant mobile Apollo and Zustand patterns
globs: apps/merchant-mobile/src/graphql/**/*,apps/merchant-mobile/src/store/**/*
---

# Apollo (`src/graphql`)

Links: `errorLink → authLink → httpLink` → `API_URL`.

- Tokens in SecureStore only — never MMKV
- On `Authentication required`, refresh via `refreshToken` mutation then retry
- Shared auth ops: `src/graphql/operations.ts`
- Feature-specific ops live under `src/features/<x>/api/`
- Reject diner/admin with `isPartnerMobileRole` after login and on `refreshMe`

# Zustand + MMKV (`src/store`)

- Persist `activeRestaurantId` (and other non-sensitive prefs) to MMKV
- Auth user/session: React context + SecureStore (`src/graphql/auth.tsx`)
